msgctxt "64"
msgid "Divine Dragon? What kinda shop is this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "It's a tattoo parlor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Seriously? You're tellin' me there's a tattoo artist holed up in there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Yeah, Master Utabori. He's the one who takes care of the tattoo on my back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Whoa... The guy's gotta be legendary if he did your dragon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Heh, you starstruck?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"No, it's just... my viper's not finished. So I was thinking, maybe, "
"y'know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "I get it. You want me to ask Master Utabori if he'll finish it up for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Would you!? I'd be honored to get work done by the same guy who worked on "
"you, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Follow me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1968"
msgid "Rikiya"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1972"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""

